title: $:/mf/gen/CLI command/mf gui layout
catalog: CLI command
target: mf gui layout
summary: Print or assign the slot layout ('-' = hidden slot)

!! Reference

```
Print or assign the slot layout ('-' = hidden slot)

Usage: mf gui layout [SLOT] [VALUE]

Arguments:
  [SLOT]
          Slot name (left or right)

  [VALUE]
          Workspace id to assign, or '-' to hide the slot

Options:
  -h, --help
          Print help
```
